('EM-TKT-INS-2064-20260917-1-1', 'TKT-INS-2064-20260917-1', 'INS-2064', 'suresh.dsouza98@rediffmail.com', 'INBOUND', 'suresh.dsouza98@rediffmail.com', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'Premium revision at renewal — justification requested', 'Dear Sir/Madam,

I have received the renewal notice for policy POL-60082. The premium has been revised upward substantially from the previous year.

