Suresh D''Souza', 1, '2026-09-17 10:00:00'),
('EM-TKT-INS-2064-20260917-1-2', 'TKT-INS-2064-20260917-1', 'INS-2064', 'suresh.dsouza98@rediffmail.com', 'OUTBOUND', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'suresh.dsouza98@rediffmail.com', 'Premium revision at renewal — justification requested', 'Dear Suresh,

Thank you for your mail, logged as ticket TKT-INS-2064-20260917-1.

Premium revisions are applied at the product level and reflect portfolio claims experience and medical inflation. We are arranging for an underwriter to walk you through the calculation.

Regards,
Customer Service', 2, '2026-09-18 12:00:00'),
