('EM-TKT-INS-2098-20260927-2-2', 'TKT-INS-2098-20260927-2', 'INS-2098', 'vidya.chowdhury18@gmail.com', 'OUTBOUND', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'vidya.chowdhury18@gmail.com', 'Premium revision at renewal — justification requested', 'Dear Vidya,

Thank you for your mail, logged as ticket TKT-INS-2098-20260927-2.

Premium revisions are applied at the product level and reflect portfolio claims experience and medical inflation. We are arranging for an underwriter to walk you through the calculation.

Regards,
Customer Service', 2, '2026-09-28 13:00:00'),
('EM-TKT-INS-2098-20260927-2-3', 'TKT-INS-2098-20260927-2', 'INS-2098', 'vidya.chowdhury18@gmail.com', 'INBOUND', 'vidya.chowdhury18@gmail.com', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'Premium revision at renewal — justification requested', 'I have not received the written justification I asked for.

