('EM-TKT-INS-2116-20261002-2-1', 'TKT-INS-2116-20261002-2', 'INS-2116', 'neha.khanna83@yahoo.co.in', 'INBOUND', 'neha.khanna83@yahoo.co.in', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'Portability procedure enquiry', 'Dear Sir/Madam,

