('EM-TKT-INS-2260-20261003-2-1', 'TKT-INS-2260-20261003-2', 'INS-2260', 'harpreet.chowdhury7@outlook.com', 'INBOUND', 'harpreet.chowdhury7@outlook.com', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'Cashless pre-authorisation delay', 'Dear Sir/Madam,

