Harpreet Chowdhury
Policy POL-60330', 1, '2026-10-03 11:00:00'),
('EM-TKT-INS-2260-20261003-2-2', 'TKT-INS-2260-20261003-2', 'INS-2260', 'harpreet.chowdhury7@outlook.com', 'OUTBOUND', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'harpreet.chowdhury7@outlook.com', 'Cashless pre-authorisation delay', 'Dear Harpreet,

