Regards,
Customer Service
Bharat Suraksha Health Insurance', 2, '2026-10-04 07:00:00'),
('EM-TKT-INS-2260-20261003-2-3', 'TKT-INS-2260-20261003-2', 'INS-2260', 'harpreet.chowdhury7@outlook.com', 'INBOUND', 'harpreet.chowdhury7@outlook.com', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'Cashless pre-authorisation delay', 'This is the third time I am writing.

