I want a written explanation of the delay and the name of the officer handling this. If I do not receive the approval today I will be raising this with the IRDAI grievance cell.

Harpreet Chowdhury', 3, '2026-10-06 15:00:00'),
('EM-TKT-INS-2260-20261003-2-4', 'TKT-INS-2260-20261003-2', 'INS-2260', 'harpreet.chowdhury7@outlook.com', 'OUTBOUND', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'harpreet.chowdhury7@outlook.com', 'Cashless pre-authorisation delay', 'Dear Harpreet,

