('EM-TKT-INS-2284-20261003-2-1', 'TKT-INS-2284-20261003-2', 'INS-2284', 'deepak.chatterjee61@rediffmail.com', 'INBOUND', 'deepak.chatterjee61@rediffmail.com', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'Cashless pre-authorisation delay', 'Dear Sir/Madam,

I am writing with reference to policy POL-60361. My cashless pre-authorisation request for claim CLM-40110 is still showing as "under review" on your portal.

