Regards,
Deepak Chatterjee
Policy POL-60361', 1, '2026-10-03 11:00:00'),
('EM-TKT-INS-2284-20261003-2-2', 'TKT-INS-2284-20261003-2', 'INS-2284', 'deepak.chatterjee61@rediffmail.com', 'OUTBOUND', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'deepak.chatterjee61@rediffmail.com', 'Cashless pre-authorisation delay', 'Dear Deepak,

