('EM-TKT-INS-2347-20261001-2-1', 'TKT-INS-2347-20261001-2', 'INS-2347', 'asha.gupta93@yahoo.co.in', 'INBOUND', 'asha.gupta93@yahoo.co.in', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'Cashless pre-authorisation delay', 'Dear Sir/Madam,

