Policy POL-60443', 1, '2026-10-01 11:00:00'),
('EM-TKT-INS-2347-20261001-2-2', 'TKT-INS-2347-20261001-2', 'INS-2347', 'asha.gupta93@yahoo.co.in', 'OUTBOUND', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'asha.gupta93@yahoo.co.in', 'Cashless pre-authorisation delay', 'Dear Asha,

Thank you for writing in. Your request has been registered under ticket TKT-INS-2347-20261001-2.

We have escalated the pre-authorisation to our TPA for review. The standard turnaround is 48 working hours from receipt of complete documentation.

Regards,
Customer Service
Bharat Suraksha Health Insurance', 2, '2026-10-02 07:00:00'),
('EM-TKT-INS-2347-20261001-2-3', 'TKT-INS-2347-20261001-2', 'INS-2347', 'asha.gupta93@yahoo.co.in', 'INBOUND', 'asha.gupta93@yahoo.co.in', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'Cashless pre-authorisation delay', 'This is the third time I am writing.

It has now been well past the 48 hours you quoted. The hospital is asking me to settle in cash and claim reimbursement later, which defeats the entire purpose of a cashless policy that I have paid INR 36,700 a year for.

I want a written explanation of the delay and the name of the officer handling this. If I do not receive the approval today I will be raising this with the IRDAI grievance cell.

Asha Gupta', 3, '2026-10-04 15:00:00'),
('EM-TKT-INS-2347-20261001-2-4', 'TKT-INS-2347-20261001-2', 'INS-2347', 'asha.gupta93@yahoo.co.in', 'OUTBOUND', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'asha.gupta93@yahoo.co.in', 'Cashless pre-authorisation delay', 'Dear Asha,

