We will revert within 24 hours.

Regards,
Customer Service', 4, '2026-10-04 19:00:00'),
('EM-TKT-INS-2347-20261002-3-1', 'TKT-INS-2347-20261002-3', 'INS-2347', 'asha.gupta93@yahoo.co.in', 'INBOUND', 'asha.gupta93@yahoo.co.in', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'Deficiency letter — documents already submitted', 'Dear Sir/Madam,

I have received a deficiency letter on claim CLM-40142 asking for the same documents I have already uploaded twice — the discharge summary and the final bill.

