Regards,
Asha Gupta', 1, '2026-10-02 12:00:00'),
('EM-TKT-INS-2347-20261002-3-2', 'TKT-INS-2347-20261002-3', 'INS-2347', 'asha.gupta93@yahoo.co.in', 'OUTBOUND', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'asha.gupta93@yahoo.co.in', 'Deficiency letter — documents already submitted', 'Dear Asha,

