('EM-TKT-INS-2347-20261004-4-1', 'TKT-INS-2347-20261004-4', 'INS-2347', 'asha.gupta93@yahoo.co.in', 'INBOUND', 'asha.gupta93@yahoo.co.in', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'Portability procedure enquiry', 'Dear Sir/Madam,

