Regards,
Rashmi D''Souza', 1, '2026-09-19 11:00:00'),
('EM-TKT-INS-2421-20260919-2-2', 'TKT-INS-2421-20260919-2', 'INS-2421', 'rashmi.dsouza79@gmail.com', 'OUTBOUND', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'rashmi.dsouza79@gmail.com', 'Premium revision at renewal — justification requested', 'Dear Rashmi,

Thank you for your mail, logged as ticket TKT-INS-2421-20260919-2.

Premium revisions are applied at the product level and reflect portfolio claims experience and medical inflation. We are arranging for an underwriter to walk you through the calculation.

Regards,
Customer Service', 2, '2026-09-20 13:00:00');

I have obtained a comparable quote from another insurer which is materially lower for the same sum insured. I have been with you for several years with a clean record.

